  Description: You live on the outskirts of civilization, combing through the detritus
    left behind for interesting trinkets to sell or use in your own crafting. Though
    you have a preferred terrain to search, you know that the greatest treasures
    occur where people make greater use of technology. Choose two attribute boosts.
    One must be to Strength or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Athletics skill and the Lore skill of the terrain in which you
    scavenge. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hefty Hauler] skill
    feat.
